      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046425">(AVX512_FP16 AND AVX512VL) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+930534"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046427">Add packed FP16 value from ymm3/m256/m16bcst to ymm2, and store result in ymm1 subject to writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
